e":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539334/5393340317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539334/5393340316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2014/SHREE_PUSHKAR_CHEMICALS_&_FERTILIZERS_LTD-539334-MARCH-2014.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2013/SHREE_PUSHKAR_CHEMICALS_&_FERTILIZERS_LTD-539334-MARCH-2013.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2012/SHREE_PUSHKAR_CHEMICALS_&_FERTILIZERS_LTD-539334-MARCH-2012.PDF","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Shree Pushkar Chemicals & Fertilisers Limited reported robust financial performance for Q2 H1 FY27, with Q2 revenue reaching Rs. 403.5 Cr, reflecting 58.2% YoY growth, and PAT increasing by 96.2% YoY to Rs. 35.7 Cr, driven by sustained demand across chemical and fertiliser segments. Management highlighted ongoing and new capital expenditure plans, including a Rs. 70 Cr investment at Ratnagiri Unit 5 for a new 3,000 MTPA chemical plant expected by March 2028.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company expects to achieve close to Rs. 1,250 crores turnover with PAT levels near 9% for the financial year.","quote":"And the kind of visibility I gave in my last concall that in this particular financial year, the company would be achieving close to Rs. 1,250 crores turnover with the PAT levels of around near to the 9% or so.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that the turnover figure could potentially move toward Rs. 1,350 crores or Rs. 1,400 crores.","quote":"I wouldn't be surprised if that figure moves toward Rs. 1,350 crores or Rs. 1,400 crores.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"With a full 12 months for Unit 6 next year, the company sees the possibility of crossing Rs. 1,700 to Rs. 1,750 crores.","quote":"So with a full 12 months, I see the possibility of crossing 1,700 to 1,750.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Revenue growth during the quarter was supported by sustained demand and improved business performance across the company's chemical and fertiliser segments.","quote":"During the quarter, Revenue from Operations stood at Rs. 403.5 Cr, registering a robust growth of 58.2% YoY, supported by sustained demand and improved business performance across the Company's Chemical and Fertiliser segments.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bfe1f304-b834-4e6c-9f8c-e3127102fa19.pdf"},{"claim":"The new chemical plant at Ratnagiri Unit 5 is aimed at catering to growing customer demand.","quote":"The project is expected to be commissioned by March 2028 and is aimed at catering to the growing demand from customers.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bfe1f304-b834-4e6c-9f8c-e3127102fa19.pdf"},{"claim":"Management noted that fertilizer sales volume was 66,527 metric tons and chemical sales volume was 9,113 metric tons during Q1 FY27.","quote":"The fertilizer business recorded the sales volume of 66,527 metric tons compared to 76,288 metric tons in Q1 FY26, while volumes in the chemical business were 9,113 metric tons compared to 14,837 metric tons in the corresponding period.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"Improved realizations across both businesses offset the impact of lower volumes and supported growth in sales value.","quote":"However, improved realization across both the businesses helped offset the impact of lower volume and supported growth in the sales value.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"Management expects Q2 demand to become even more apparent and better than Q1.","quote":"In Q2, the demand is becoming even more apparent. Also, Q1 being the start of the financial year and the beginning of the conflict, people were a bit slow in purchasing as they wanted to wait and see how things behaved.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"Unit 8 at Meghnagar is adding 3,000,000 MTPA capacity for complex fertilisers.","quote":"StrategicgrowthplanatMeghnagarUnit8,adding3,00,000MTPAcapacityfortheComplexFertilisers","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bfe1f304-b834-4e6c-9f8c-e3127102fa19.pdf"},{"claim":"Projects are underway at Ratnagiri Unit 6 and Unit 5 adding 150,000 MTPA and 69,000 MTPA capacities across fertilisers and chemicals.","quote":"ProjectsunderwayatRatnagiriUnitsat6andnewProjectatUnit5adding1,50,000MTPAand69,000MTPAcapacitiesacrossFertilisersandChemicals","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bfe1f304-b834-4e6c-9f8c-e3127102fa19.pdf"},{"claim":"At Ratnagiri, Unit 5 and Unit 6 are at the advanced stage of completion.","quote":"At Ratnagiri, Unit 5 and Unit 6 are at the advanced stage of completion, given the continued volatility in raw material prices and availability.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"These projects are expected to add 4,50,000 metric tons per annum of fertilizer capacity and 72,000 metric tons per annum of chemical capacity.","quote":"Together, these projects are expected to add 4,50,000 metric tons per annum of fertilizer capacity and 72,000 metric tons per annum of the chemical capacity additionally, significantly expanding the company's manufacturing base.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"The company acquired approximately 30,000 square meters of additional land at Lote Parshuram for Rs. 9.33 crores.","quote":"During the quarter, the company acquired approximately 30,000 square meters of additional land at Lote Parshuram for Rs. 9.33 crores, located near the existing Unit 1.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"Cumulative capex incurred stands at Rs. 209 crores as of June 30, 2026, against the total planned capex of Rs. 512 crores.","quote":"With this, cumulative capex incurred stands at Rs. 209 crores as of June 30, 2026, against the total planned capex of Rs. 512 crores.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"The 10 megawatt DC solar power project at Nanded is nearing completion, which will take total installed solar capacity to 20.6 megawatt on DC basis.","quote":"The 10 megawatt DC solar power project at Nanded is nearing completion and once commissioned, we will take the company's total installed solar capacity to 20.6 megawatt on DC basis.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Q2 FY27 EBITDA margin stood at approximately 12.0%, reflecting an 88% growth.","quote":"From a profitability perspective, the Company delivered EBITDA of Rs. 50 Cr with an EBITDA margin of approximately 12.0%, reflecting a growth of 88 YoY.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bfe1f304-b834-4e6c-9f8c-e3127102fa19.pdf"},{"claim":"Consolidated EBITDA for Q2 FY27 was Rs. 49.2 Cr with an EBITDA margin of 12.2%.","quote":"EBITDA 49.2 26.2 87.7% 29.1 54.2% 81.2 55.3 46.6%","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bfe1f304-b834-4e6c-9f8c-e3127102fa19.pdf"},{"claim":"EBITDA increased by 9.7% year-on-year to Rs. 31.9 crores with a margin of 11.4%.","quote":"EBITDA increased by 9.7% year-on-year to Rs. 31.9 crores with a margin of 11.4%, while profit after tax grew by 9.4% to Rs. 22.9 crores with a margin of 8.2%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"Gross profit was Rs. 89.2 crores, registering a growth of 6.3% year-on-year with a margin of 31.9%.","quote":"Gross profit was Rs. 89.2 crores, registering a growth of 6.3% year-on-year with the margin of 31.9%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"Sulphur prices have risen from the range of USD250-USD300 to USD1,100.","quote":"Specifically, if I talk about sulphur, sulphur, which used to be in the range of USD250-USD300, in today's date, only sulphur is in the range of USD1,100.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"Sales volume across chemicals and fertilisers reached approximately 3.25 lakh MTPA.","quote":"Sales volume of ~3.25 lakh MTPA across Chemicals and Fertilisers demonstrates scale and capacity utilisation •","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bfe1f304-b834-4e6c-9f8c-e3127102fa19.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"Growth is funded through internal accruals and preferential allotment of warrants.","quote":"Growthtobefundedthroughinternalaccrualsandpreferentialallotment,reflectingstrongcashflowsanddisciplinedcapitalallocation","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bfe1f304-b834-4e6c-9f8c-e3127102fa19.pdf"},{"claim":"The company maintains Rs. 142.83 Cr in non-lien deposits as of 30th September 2026.","quote":"Maintains Rs. 142.83 Cr in non-lien deposits as on 30th September, 2026","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bfe1f304-b834-4e6c-9f8c-e3127102fa19.pdf"},{"claim":"The company maintains a comfortable liquidity position with Rs. 125 crores in non-lien deposits as on June 30, 2026.","quote":"From a liquidity perspective, the company continues to maintain a comfortable position with Rs. 125 crores in non-lien deposits as on June 30, 2026.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"The balance investment for capex will be funded through internal accruals and proceeds from the preferential issue.","quote":"The balance investment will be deployed progressively as the projects advance, with the overall program being funded through the internal accruals and proceeds from the preferential issue.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Performance was achieved despite continued challenges around global supply chain and elevated raw material prices.","quote":"The performance was achieved despite continued challenges around global supply chain and elevated raw material prices.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"There was an acute shortage of ammonia and sulphur due to the closure of Hormuz.","quote":"Like ammonia is a major raw material into that, sulphur is a major raw material into that, and suddenly there was acute shortage of these two raw materials because of the closure of the Hormuz.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"Q1 FY27 revenue grew 10.0% YoY despite ongoing global supply chain challenges and elevated raw material prices.","quote":"During Q1 FY27, the Company reported Revenue from Operations of Rs. 280.1 Cr, registering a growth of 10.0% YoY despite ongoing global supply chain challenges and elevated raw material prices.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=97fb4e8b-1bb6-4200-8f3d-07503dd25269.pdf"},{"claim":"Sales volumes across both segments were impacted by the prevailing operating environment during the quarter.","quote":"During the quarter, sales volumes across both segments were impacted by the prevailing operating environment.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=97fb4e8b-1bb6-4200-8f3d-07503dd25269.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The new chemical plant at Ratnagiri Unit 5 is expected to be commissioned by March 2028.","quote":"The project is expected to be commissioned by March 2028 and is aimed at catering to the growing demand from customers.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bfe1f304-b834-4e6c-9f8c-e3127102fa19.pdf","timeframe":"March 2028"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_ppt","concall_transcript"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":30,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":8,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}